  "title": "One-Pan Honey Mustard Salmon and Asparagus - Quick Dinner",
  "description": "This one-pan honey mustard salmon and asparagus delivers 34g of protein in just 25 minutes. Fresh salmon fillets and tender asparagus spears roast together on a single baking sheet with a tangy glaze. Save it for your next easy weeknight dinner.",
